codex
The launcher fault is now identified: inside this container, Lean asks for `/proc/<runtime-pid>/exe`, but that PID is absent from the mounted `/proc`, so initialization aborts. I’ll use a process-local compatibility shim that redirects only that failed executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; this leaves the pinned toolchain, dependencies, Base project, and proof sources unchanged.
